0.216 0.616 0.753 rg
BT /F2 9.80 Tf 42.00 561.89 Td (2.1 Mission Statement) Tj ET
0.840 0.900 0.940 RG
0.60 w 42.00 558.89 m 553.28 558.89 l S
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 545.39 Td (The mission of the Multi-Agent Robotic Systems \(MARS\) platform is to provide a general-purpose, modular, and) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 534.19 Td (extensible robotic platform for research, development, and experimentation in multi-robot systems.) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 519.99 Td (The platform is intended to support a broad range of research activities, including self-reconfigurable multi-robot) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 508.79 Td (systems, cooperative object transportation, multi-robot navigation, search and rescue, and cooperative area coverage.) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 494.59 Td (It aims to provide researchers with a common and reusable experimental infrastructure for investigating multi-robot) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 483.39 Td (coordination, communication, control, perception, localization, and autonomous decision-making under various operational) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 472.19 Td (conditions.) Tj ET
0.216 0.616 0.753 rg
BT /F2 9.80 Tf 42.00 452.49 Td (2.2 Operational Objectives) Tj ET
0.840 0.900 0.940 RG
0.60 w 42.00 449.49 m 553.28 449.49 l S
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 435.99 Td (The platform is intended to achieve the following operational objectives.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 418.79 Td (O-01  -  Research Flexibility) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 405.79 Td (Support different research applications without requiring fundamental redesign of the entire robotic platform.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 388.59 Td (O-02  -  Multi-Robot Cooperation) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 375.59 Td (Enable multiple robotic agents to perform individual and cooperative tasks.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 358.39 Td (O-03  -  Decentralized Operation) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 345.39 Td (Support research into decentralized coordination and decision-making, where robots can exchange information and) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 334.19 Td (coordinate their actions without depending entirely on a central controller.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 316.99 Td (O-04  -  Physical Reconfiguration) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 303.99 Td (Support experiments in which individual robots physically connect to form a larger composite robotic system and) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 292.79 Td (subsequently disconnect to resume independent operation.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 275.59 Td (O-05  -  Manual Operability) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 262.59 Td (Allow operators to wirelessly control individual robots for testing, positioning, debugging, calibration, demonstrations, and) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 251.39 Td (recovery.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 234.19 Td (O-06  -  Experimental Reproducibility) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 221.19 Td (Provide a common experimental infrastructure that allows researchers to configure, execute, observe, and evaluate) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 209.99 Td (experiments consistently.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 192.79 Td (O-07  -  Accessibility and Usability) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 179.79 Td (Allow researchers from different technical backgrounds to prepare and operate experiments without requiring extensive) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 168.59 Td (expertise in every aspect of robotics.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 151.39 Td (O-08  -  Extensibility) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 138.39 Td (Allow researchers to introduce new hardware modules, sensors, algorithms, and experimental configurations as research) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 127.19 Td (requirements evolve.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 109.99 Td (O-09  -  Operational Reliability) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 96.99 Td (Provide a platform that can be prepared, deployed, operated, recovered, and maintained repeatedly for research) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 85.79 Td (activities.) Tj ET
