BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 319.59 Td (A. Manual Robot Control) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 306.59 Td (An operator directly controls the movement of an individual robot through a wireless interface.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
BT /F2 9.00 Tf 44.00 289.39 Td (B. Centralized Fleet Supervision) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 276.39 Td (An operator or external system monitors multiple robots and may issue commands to individual robots or the team.) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.70 Tf 44.00 262.19 Td (This arrangement is primarily intended for experiment management and supervision.) Tj ET
0.161 0.224 0.322 rg
